a live testing.

00:15:26.929 --> 00:15:28.470
And this is kind of
state of the art.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:29.970
So most new developer
portals have

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:31.620
something like this,
where they make

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:34.710
it really easy for a
developer to try out the API.

